{"chunk_id": "8d64bb7be913", "text": "After the triumphant return of the search party, the monkeys descend from the sky before Rama, their success evident in their joyful uproar. Hanuman bows and delivers the long\u2011awaited news: he has found Sita. Rama and Lakshmana are overwhelmed with relief and reverence for Hanuman\u2019s achievement. At Mount Prasravana, Hanuman recounts his journey across the vast ocean to Lanka and describes Sita\u2019s captivity in Ravana\u2019s inner quarters, guarded by terrifying demonesses. Though emaciated with grief, she remains unwaveringly devoted to Rama and rejects Ravana\u2019s advances. As proof of their meeting, Hanuman presents the radiant jewel she entrusted to him and relays her urgent message: she can endure only one more month in captivity. The moment confirms Sita\u2019s fidelity and sets the stage for the coming rescue and war.\nHanuman returns to Rama, reports Sita\u2019s captivity and steadfast devotion in Lanka, and delivers her jewel and message urging Rama to rescue her within a month.\nThemes: loyalty and devotion, messenger testimony, hope after despair, Sita's steadfastness, impending rescue", "vector": [-0.003172248136252165, -0.027604123577475548, -0.007089915685355663, -0.0026545021682977676, -0.014773468486964703, 0.01438220776617527, -0.017768636345863342, 0.0055080074816942215, -0.015083778649568558, -0.00453322846442461, 0.008864080533385277, 0.025472426787018776, 0.006583974696695805, 0.0063310046680271626, 0.003666383447125554, -0.011009269393980503, 0.04665447771549225, -0.01123862899839878, 0.01694563962519169, -0.025566870346665382, -0.0038923704996705055, -0.024932757019996643, -0.019131304696202278, 0.0008660018211230636, -0.014314748346805573, -0.01156917680054903, 0.030248507857322693, -0.03793880715966225, 0.01840274967253208, -0.008668450638651848, -0.024501021951436996, -0.01632501929998398, -0.018227357417345047, -0.006782978307455778, -0.022032029926776886, 0.007852199487388134, -0.0017707